# 换行与二进制处理
# 仓库内统一存 LF，工作区保持原样；避免 Windows/Linux 双端协作时出现"整文件被改写"的假 diff。
* text=auto

# 后端跑在 Linux 服务器上，这几类强制 LF
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.php text eol=lf
*.py  text eol=lf

# 资源文件不做任何换行转换
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.otf   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip   binary
*.7z    binary
*.dll   binary
*.exe   binary
*.so    binary
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.pptx  binary

# Preserve the supplied operation skill byte-for-byte, including its original newlines.
MoonYa-Backend/skills/computer-use-automation/SKILL.md -text
